	<key>readme</key>
	<string># Change Case

Use `case text` to transform typed text. Use `case` with no text to transform clipboard text. Use the Universal Action on selected text, or configure the included hotkey.

Return copies to clipboard. Command-Return pastes to the frontmost app. Option-Return pins or unpins a case.

Implemented without npm packages or Alfred workflow libraries.</string>
